---
import './SellerHero.css';
---

<section class="seller-hero">
  <div class="seller-hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">Rumy Cakes for bakers</p>
    <h1>Keep more of what<br /><span class="hero-em">you bake.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">Build your cake business with a marketplace made for fresh, local baking. Share your menu, take orders, and go live when the oven is on.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="seller-button" href="#apply">Apply to sell</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="#fees">Explore seller fees</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-note">Simple, transparent pricing for independent bakeries.</p>
  </div>
</section>
